  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid QCNN–classical model (HQCNN) for cryptocurrency price forecasting where amplitude-encoded features are processed by a QCNN and then a Transformer/LSTM predictor. On a CoinGecko-derived dataset the best configuration (4 quantum layers + amplitude encoding + Transformer) achieves MAE 0.023 and RMSE 0.036, outperforming reported classical baselines such as LSTM (MAE 0.040, RMSE 0.056) and Transformer (MAE 0.035, RMSE 0.050). All results are obtained via quantum circuit simulation on classical hardware (RTX 3090 GPU).",
